Package: AvianViromeDB
Title: Avian Virome Database
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Jinlong", "Ru", , "jinlong.ru@tum.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Code for AvianViromeDB, a DNA-focused catalog of avian gut viral
    sequences assembled from public, predominantly poultry metagenomes, with
    quality estimates, source associations and computational annotations.
